OL,3,GNEWSAFresh attempt to kickstart stalled
OL,4,Astation revamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fresh attempt to find a contractor to
OL,7,Fcarry out a major revamp of Leicester's
OL,8,Frailway station is underway.
OL,10,FLeicester City Council is leading a
OL,11,Fproject to refurbish the London Road
OL,12,Fstation but the scheme has been delayed
OL,13,Fby a failure to find a specialist firm
OL,14,Fable to do the work.
OL,16,FThe authority has now put the contract
OL,17,Fout to tender again after earmarking an
OL,18,Fextra #10m of government money to try
OL,19,Fto make it more attractive to
OL,20,Fdevelopment companies.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
